<hor. epod. 14.1>	Mollis inertia cur tantam diffuderit imis
<hor. epod. 14.2>	oblivionem sensibus,
<hor. epod. 14.3>	pocula Lethaeos ut si ducentia somnos
<hor. epod. 14.4>	arente fauce traxerim,
<hor. epod. 14.5>	candide Maecenas, occidis Saepe rogando:
<hor. epod. 14.6>	deus, deus nam me vetat
<hor. epod. 14.7>	inceptos, olim promissum carmen, iambos
<hor. epod. 14.8>	ad umbilicum adducere.
<hor. epod. 14.9>	non aliter Samio dicunt arsisse Bathyllo
<hor. epod. 14.10>	Anacreonta Teium,
<hor. epod. 14.11>	qui persaepe cava testudine flevit amorem
<hor. epod. 14.12>	non elaboratum ad pedem.
<hor. epod. 14.13>	ureris ipse miser: quodsi non pulcrior ignis
<hor. epod. 14.14>	accendit obsessam Ilion,
<hor. epod. 14.15>	gaude sorte tua; me libertina, nec uno
<hor. epod. 14.16>	contenta, Phryne macerat.
